      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Analytics permits a small set of first-party product…",
      "text": "Analytics permits a small set of first-party product events, such as page views. Those events use broad page categories rather than article slugs or private resource IDs. No optional analytics events are queued before consent.",
