      "kind": "text",
      "name": "External media permits embedded YouTube or Vimeo players…",
      "text": "External media permits embedded YouTube or Vimeo players to load. Those providers receive requests from your browser when enabled. Withdrawing that choice prevents future player loading and removes mounted players.",
